# Baked into every production build (Vercel), so the hosting dashboard needs
# no environment variables. All three are public by design: they end up in
# the browser's JavaScript. The publishable key cannot read any table (RLS is
# on everywhere and nothing is granted to the API roles); the backend's staff
# check is what protects the data. A variable set in Vercel overrides these.
